  "limitations": "Original reconstruction of the open Type 96 triple measured against GameModels3D pjsa108 (jga173); the trunnion datum is derived from the reference barrels baked at 30 degrees; each gun keeps its own cradle, case chute and grips; the long port elevating link is omitted and the chutes and rear grips are shortened to clear the deck at full elevation; seats, sight and hand wheel are simplified; standalone fidelity and articulation acceptance have not been certified.",
